<details><summary>How figures are calculated</summary><p>Today includes bookings overlapping the business-local day, excluding Cancelled. New enquiries are current New requests. Awaiting responses counts Sent quotes expiring today or later. Recorded payments are ledger entries, not bank reconciliation or revenue. Reversals offset the original payment date, so corrected past months update. No money is collected here. Currencies are never combined or converted.</p><p>Unpaid means an issued invoice with no net payment. Part paid means an issued invoice with some balance remaining. Overdue means an unpaid balance with a due date before today; invoices due today are not overdue. Outstanding adds each issued invoice balance once. Draft, Paid and Void invoices are excluded. Overdue is included in Unpaid and Part paid counts. Staff assignments do not multiply bookings or money totals.</p></details></section>
